@startuml ConnectHub_Sequence_GetFeed
actor User
participant "React Frontend" as FE
participant "ContentController" as CC
participant "ContentService" as CS
participant "FriendshipRepository" as FR
participant "ContentRepository" as CR
database "MySQL" as DB

User -> FE: Open Newsfeed
FE -> CC: GET /content/feed/posts?page=0&size=10 (Bearer JWT)
CC -> CS: getFriendPosts(userId, page, size)
CS -> FR: findAcceptedFriendships(userId)
FR -> DB: SELECT friendships WHERE status=ACCEPTED
DB --> FR: List<Friendship>
FR --> CS: List<UUID> friendIds
CS -> FR: findBlockedUserIds(userId)
FR -> DB: SELECT blocked user ids
DB --> FR: List<UUID> blockedIds
FR --> CS: blockedIds
CS -> CS: friendIds.removeAll(blockedIds)
CS -> CR: findFriendContent(friendIds, POST, pageable)
CR -> DB: SELECT content WHERE authorId IN (?) ORDER BY timestamp DESC
DB --> CR: Page<Content>
CR --> CS: Page<Content>
CS --> CC: Page<ContentDto>
CC --> FE: 200 OK + Page<ContentDto>
FE --> User: Renders post cards
@enduml